OL,3,GNEWSAAI GP receptionist 'can't
OL,4,Aunderstand Yorkshire accent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPatients in Rotherham are struggling
OL,7,Fwith a new artificial intelligence GP
OL,8,Freceptionist because it can't
OL,9,Funderstand the Yorkshire accent,
OL,10,Faccording to a health watchdog.
OL,12,FSome surgeries are triaging patients
OL,13,Fusing a nationwide AI system called
OL,14,FEMMA to avoid long wait times on the
OL,15,Fphone.
OL,17,FHealthwatch Rotherham said some
OL,18,Fpatients could not get the system to
OL,19,Funderstand them as it does not respond
OL,20,Fwell to variations in speech such as
OL,21,Fregional accents or speech impediments.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
