OL,3,GNEWSAAI GP receptionist 'can't
OL,4,Aunderstand Yorkshire accent'
OL,5,
OL,6,FQuantumLoopAI, the company behind the
OL,7,Fsystem, said EMMA was designed to
OL,8,Funderstand a range of dialects and
OL,9,Fpatients can speak to a human at any
OL,10,Ftime.
